ergy for people. Progress for society. Searching for better.\nWe are headquartered in Norway with around 25,000 employees and offices in more than 20 countries. A major supplier of energy to Europe, with a portfolio that encompasses oil and gas, renewables, and low-carbon solutions. Equinor is a world-leading offshore operator with a growing power business and positions in CO2 transportation and storage.\nOur deliveries of oil, gas, and wind power provide a vital contribution to Europe’s energy security.\nThe Norwegian continental shelf is the backbone of the company, while our international oil and gas portfolio is focused on a set of core positions in the US, Brazil, Angola, the UK and Canada.\nOur power business is built around onshore and offshore wind, supplemented by solar assets, in countries like Poland, the UK, Brazil and Norway.\nWe aim to provide reliable energy for a world in transition, enabling access to secure, affordable and low-emission energy for people and society. Building on a foundation of low-risk positions and 50 years of experience, we are well placed to grow our businesses and create long-term value.\nIn Equinor, we believe that collaboration across disciplines, companies, and countries holds the key to providing the reliable energy the world needs.","content_sha256":"47a43f1a960f5fe54525b3bac7cd99c9b4face4c49d6bd24f1919e1f2597b346"},{"url":"https://www.equinor.com/about-us/accessibility-statement","title":"","main_text_excerpt":"At Equinor, we aim to make our website, equinor.com, accessible to as many users as possible, and we are continuously working to improve accessibility and usability based on current standards and guidelines.\nAccessibility statement\nObjectives\nOur goal is to achieve, at a minimum, Level AA compliance with the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1.","content_sha256":"4c69d09410e6f0f32f3fadcfff69be5518a6a954d928e694e3d2ff52a114cc6a"},{"url":"https://www.equinor.com/about-us/contact-us","title":"","main_text_excerpt":"How to contact us\nFirst things first. If your enquiry is urgent or related to a safety issue, please call us immediately at the number below.\nHeadquarters: Equinor ASA\nForusbeen 50,\n4035 Stavanger,\nNorway\nSecondly, to help us help you, please send your enquiry to the right team in Equinor. You’ll find all our direct contacts below. We can only answer relevant enquiries, and we don’t respond to questions about jobs or unsolicited sales offers.","content_sha256":"bae370fd35beec134916494404aa5b4e01a02ec84a12e058c9fa6a94abc10c3e"},{"url":"https://www.equinor.com/about-us/privacy-policy","title":"","main_text_excerpt":"1. Introduction\n2. Equinor’s processing of personal data\n2.1. General\n2.2 Procurement and other business relation purposes\n2.3. Integrity Due Diligence\n2.4. Ethics Helpline\n2.5. Local grievance mechanisms\n2.6. The Norwegian Transparency Act\n2.7. Screening\n2.8 Communication\n2.9 Recruitment and onboarding\n2.10 Security and emergency response\n2.11 Recordings of certain trading activities\n2.12 Equinor Pension\n2.13 Asset Management in Equinor\n2.14 Website and cookies\n3. Categories and collection of personal data\n4. Transfer and sharing of personal data\n5. How to exercise your rights as a data subject and DPO contact information\n6. Notice to California Residents\n7. Notice to Japanese Residents of data transfers\n8. Notice to Brazilian Residents  \n9. Changes to this privacy policy","content_sha256":"1c8fec97d136c4b09793f31ac6995589f8cddd3a4df0c8afd892339d128a954d"}],"crawl_errors":[],"identity_assessment":{"status":"related_or_uncertain","score":0.3,"publishable":false,"legal_name_tokens":["equinor"],"matched_tokens":["equinor"],"reasons":["registry-linked URL lacks strong exact-entity identity evidence"],"method":"deterministic_name_org_evidence_v2"},"discovered_social_links":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://facebook.com/Equinor"},{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://instagram.com/equinor"},{"platform":"linkedin","